  "totalBlocks": 39,
  "translatedBlocks": 37,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b92b360abe1a0f6",
      "translationZh": "这是对我大约两周前那篇帖子的后续更新。此后发生了很多变化，所以我想再发一篇，介绍一下后端目前的进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "71d27edf9e181f17",
      "translationZh": "已通过验证的架构目前进展如何",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec7bf39c770adcd4",
      "translationZh": "上次发帖时，已有 7 种架构通过了完整训练支持的验证。现在，所有架构都采用同一套严格的测试框架：以固定版本的本地 Hugging Face Transformers 源码树作为参考基准，对比前向传播的 logits、梯度以及两个完整的 AdamW 步骤，并在导出后再次检查每一个具名参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d727b1f94e8329c4",
      "translationZh": "绝对误差的硬性上限是 2e-7。不会放宽容差，也不会事后对数值进行舍入来让 README 看起来更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb429f9439e18883",
      "translationZh": "如今已有 14 种架构通过这一关，其中领头的是我可能最引以为傲的那个：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9682b1a56e2a057",
      "translationZh": "每一层都包含并行的 GQA/RoPE 注意力与 Mamba2；支持完整训练、完整微调、LoRA 和保存的模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0035d023907d9471",
      "translationZh": "因果语言模型，包括路由器偏置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d07fed622e168bf6",
      "translationZh": "稠密、DeltaNet、QSA、PLE、MoE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b24c7f04ceb7efa",
      "translationZh": "在所有这些模型中观测到的两步 AdamW 参数误差最大值：1.19e-7。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d5eb6c1dac86659",
      "translationZh": "补充一下硬件背景：我一直在汇报的所有本地 Vulkan 验证，都是在我的 ASUS ROG Ally Z1 Extreme 上运行的，使用的是它的 AMD RDNA 3 集成 GPU。因此，这里的 RDNA 3 结果来自这台特定的机器，而不是对多个不同 AMD 系统进行测试所得的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b681ac995d4327ca",
      "translationZh": "更大的消息：PEFT 现在真的能用了",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50357bd547a00776",
      "translationZh": "在上一篇文章中，“LoRA/PEFT 风格的微调”基本上只是功能列表中的一行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7cecc9a1105ca38",
      "translationZh": "现在它已经成为一套真正可用的工作流程，而且我已经验证了完整的生命周期：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa45a4727f5df100",
      "translationZh": "LoRA 微调支持导出与 HF 兼容的适配器（adapter_config.json / adapter_model.safetensors），因此适配器可以与 PEFT 生态系统进行双向交换",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49267b160ff3a4e9",
      "translationZh": "modules_to_save — 为 Linears、RMSNorm/LayerNorm、lm_head 和输入嵌入提供完全可训练的替代模块，包括按名称切换适配器和参数库隔离。测试明确检查了适配器 A 是否会泄漏到适配器 B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60ab27134f1bccef",
      "translationZh": "精确恢复 — 恢复适配器权重 + AdamW 矩状态 + 步数 + dropout RNG 状态后，与不间断运行的结果逐比特一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f30cbdde43c279b7",
      "translationZh": "合并/解除合并、禁用适配器时恢复基座，以及多适配器加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3e63de5ab45caf4",
      "translationZh": "一个参数预算标志，可自动选择不超过基座模型指定参数量百分比的最大 LoRA 秩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42a061e3c26e6e64",
      "translationZh": "如果你尝试在尚未通过对应验证门槛的架构上使用保存的模块，CLI 会采取默认拒绝策略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3d9c4b847b776aa",
      "translationZh": "20 个系列中的 32 个架构支持面，在同一个 2e-7 验证门槛下通过了全部三个 PEFT 阶段 — LoRA、保存的模块和适配器切换 — 且冻结基座的漂移恰好为 0.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ae73072e0fd8d66",
      "translationZh": "现在，验证框架还会对锁定版本的 Transformers 源码以及我的着色器和二进制文件生成指纹，因此一次资格验证运行不会在无声无息间变成针对不同参考数学计算的测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "90d8fdf44782a002",
      "translationZh": "关于过去几周的一点小记",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "829ee80a4037a308",
      "translationZh": "过去两周里，我能工作的天数没有平时那么多。中途我感染了新冠，等症状开始消退时，又继发了严重的耳部感染，最后导致鼓膜穿孔。有一阵子我发烧到大约 104°F，最终去了医院，所以因此耽误了几天，现在还在服用抗生素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f09fc0a09063508",
      "translationZh": "不过，我现在好些了，而且仍然完成了大部分原本想做的事情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c5fc15d322dc1ec",
      "translationZh": "还有一些东西我想整理和扩展，但我觉得现在是把当前成果展示给大家的好时机，而不是继续拖着不发布更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f63daff00e1445ab",
      "translationZh": "注意事项与之前相同",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50621a70e001d81d",
      "translationZh": "这里验证的是确定性 FP32 小模型相对于参考实现的正确性，理论上，这应该能确保使用该后端训练和微调更大模型时，在数学上完全一致。不过，目前仍然只能进行 FP32 训练。我最终计划研究 MXFP4 权重绑定，以减少微调时的内存占用（在这种配置下，可调整的参数仍将通过 PEFT 以 FP32 进行训练）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0db2f011c6695667",
      "translationZh": "“支持文本计算图”≠“整个多模态套件都能原生运行”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf019f345662e095",
      "translationZh": "不受支持的功能应当以拒绝执行的方式失败，而不是悄悄回退到近似实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5bbf3e410f90d6e6",
      "translationZh": "架构清单：hierarchos-vulkan/README_ARCHITECTURES.md",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5986402e2cdc900",
      "translationZh": "兼容性／对等性记录：hierarchos-vulkan/COMPATIBILITY.md",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5cbbe5b7bb8f8f4",
      "translationZh": "PEFT 验证证据：PROGRESS_PEFT_AUDIT.md",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acd8c3363ec23212",
      "translationZh": "CLI PEFT 指南：hierarchos-native-cli/README.md",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "191e4fc4cdb7b1c1",
      "translationZh": "我亲自验证过的硬件是一台 ASUS ROG Ally Z1 Extreme，搭载 AMD RDNA 3 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ec5d198cd4f6184",
      "translationZh": "我非常期待批评意见、兼容性报告，尤其是大家在其他硬件上尝试运行的结果——NVIDIA、Intel 或其他 AMD GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d89fda3aa979bda0",
      "translationZh": "我也非常希望大家专门对 PEFT 的恢复／合并流程进行压力测试。这是项目中最新的一部分代码，所以目前最值得尝试找出问题的，很可能就是这一块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cdf8e69b4edfac8",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/PhysicsDisastrous462 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
